{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/i18n/runtime","title":"The runtime","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"the-runtime","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The runtime"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"createI18nRuntime"},{"t":"text","text":" turns a set of locales into the object the application"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"translates through. It holds one active locale, and it is deliberately small:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"locale"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"setLocale"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"translate"},{"t":"text","text":" (aliased "},{"t":"code","text":"t"},{"t":"text","text":"), "},{"t":"code","text":"bind"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"loadLocale"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { createI18nRuntime } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/i18n'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"i18n"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"createI18nRuntime","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  locales,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  defaultLocale: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'en-US'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// The time zone belongs here, once, rather than on every call site.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  timeZone: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'UTC'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"strict"},{"t":"text","text":" defaults to "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"on"}]},{"t":"text","text":". At construction, every catalogue is validated and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"every locale is checked for parity against the first one — so a catalogue built"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"in a way the types could not see still fails at startup rather than at the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"moment a user opens the page that needs it. Pass "},{"t":"code","text":"strict: false"},{"t":"text","text":" only when you"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"have a reason you can write down."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"timeZone"},{"t":"text","text":" belongs on the runtime, once. Putting it on each call site is how two"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"dates in the same view end up in two zones."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"translating","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Translating"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"i18n.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"t","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'order.total'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", { amount: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1234.5","kind":"number"},{"text":" }); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// 'Order total €1,234.50.'","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"i18n.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"setLocale","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'fr-FR'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"i18n.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"t","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'order.items'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", { count: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":" }); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// '2 articles sont dans la commande.'","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"t"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"is"}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"translate"},{"t":"text","text":" — the same function under two names, so a call site can"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"read as "},{"t":"code","text":"t('order.total', …)"},{"t":"text","text":" without a local alias. The params argument is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"optional exactly when the message has no parameters, and required, with its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"exact shape, when it does."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"setLocale(id)"},{"t":"text","text":" throws "},{"t":"code","text":"I18nRuntimeError"},{"t":"text","text":" with the code "},{"t":"code","text":"LOCALE_NOT_LOADED"},{"t":"text","text":" for"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a locale the runtime does not hold. So does "},{"t":"code","text":"t"},{"t":"text","text":", if the active locale was"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"somehow never loaded. The error is not a formatting failure to be swallowed: it"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"means the app is about to render the wrong language."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The other codes it raises, all for the same reason — rendering something wrong"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is worse than not rendering:"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"code"}],[{"t":"text","text":"when"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"MISSING_PARAM"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a token's parameter is absent from the params object"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"INVALID_PARAM"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a guard rejected the value, or a schema's issues, quoted verbatim"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"ASYNC_SCHEMA"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a parameter's schema returned a promise; a message renders in sync"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_INJECTION_REQUIRED"}],[{"t":"code","text":"t"},{"t":"text","text":" met a token that resolves a service (see below)"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"INVALID_PLURAL_COUNT"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a plural selector that is not a finite number"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"UNKNOWN_KEY"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a key that no longer exists in the loaded catalogue"}]]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"reactive-translation","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Reactive translation"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A string that does not change when the locale changes is not a translation."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"runtime.bind(dependency)"},{"t":"text","text":" returns a translator whose result re-reads whenever"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the dependency does — the dependency being an ordinary Craft reader, typically"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the "},{"t":"code","text":"state"},{"t":"text","text":" that holds the active locale:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftExpose, craftService, state } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"type","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"Locale","kind":"type"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'en-US'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" "},{"text":"|","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'fr-FR'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// One service owns the active locale, and `bind` turns the runtime into a","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// translator that re-reads whenever that state changes. Components consume the","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// service; nothing builds a local binding.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"I18n"},{"text":" } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftService","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  { name: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'I18n'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", providedIn: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'global'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"runtime"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"createI18nRuntime","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ locales, defaultLocale: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'en-US'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"language"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"state","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'language'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'en-US'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" "},{"text":"as","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"Locale","kind":"type"},{"text":", ({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"set"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"setLocale","kind":"function"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"next"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"Locale","kind":"type"},{"text":") {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        runtime.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"setLocale","kind":"function"},{"text":"(next);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"set","kind":"function"},{"text":"(next);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }));","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// Consumers use the scoped method at `I18n.language.setLocale`.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftExpose","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'translate'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", runtime.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"bind","kind":"function"},{"text":"(language));","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"translate('order.items', { count })"},{"t":"text","text":" then returns a generator the template"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"yields like any other Craft reader. One service owns the locale for the whole"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"app; components consume it rather than each building a local binding, which is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"what keeps two components from disagreeing about which language is on screen."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"di-inside-a-translation","children":[{"t":"text","text":"DI inside a translation"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Dependencies belong to the token that needs them, not to the whole i18n"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"runtime:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"orderAmount"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"money","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'amount'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"currency"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"ClientCurrency","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { currency: currency.code, minimumFractionDigits: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":" };","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"catalog"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"defineCatalog","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  order: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"msg","kind":"function"},{"text":"`Order total ${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"orderAmount","kind":"string"},{"text":"}.`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"In a template, the translator's result is used exactly like any other child or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"attribute value — pass it, do not drive it:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"translate","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'order'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", { amount: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1234.5","kind":"number"},{"text":" }));","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ title: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"translate","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'order'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", { amount: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1234.5","kind":"number"},{"text":" }) }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Order'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Both forms carry "},{"t":"code","text":"ClientCurrency"},{"t":"text","text":" into the component dependency contract, so"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the route check reports a missing provider at compile time, just as it does for"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a service the component yields."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The reader is a function, so "},{"t":"code","text":"yield* translate(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" does not type-check; and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"driving it yourself inside a template generator ("},{"t":"code","text":"yield* translate(...)()"},{"t":"text","text":")"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"hides the dependency from that check, exactly as a service yielded straight"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"from a template does. Pass the reader."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"t"},{"t":"text","text":" refuses such a message at compile time: its key type is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"StaticTranslationKey"},{"t":"text","text":", the keys whose formatting resolves nothing. A resolver"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that yields no request is still a "},{"t":"code","text":"t"},{"t":"text","text":" key — the type and the runtime draw the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"same line."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"loading-catalogues","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Loading catalogues"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { createI18nLoader } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/i18n'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// Caches by id, and — the part that matters — evicts a *failed* load, so a","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// catalogue whose chunk died on a flaky network can be retried instead of","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// staying permanently poisoned.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"loader"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"createI18nLoader","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"id"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"string","kind":"type"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"`./locales/${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"id","kind":"string"},{"text":"}.ts`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":").","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"then","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"module"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"module","kind":"type"},{"text":".locale),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"runtime"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"createI18nRuntime","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  locales,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  defaultLocale: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'en-US'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  loader,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"createI18nLoader"},{"t":"text","text":" caches by id and — the part that matters — "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"evicts a failed"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"load"}]},{"t":"text","text":", so a catalogue whose chunk died on a flaky network can be retried"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"instead of staying permanently poisoned. "},{"t":"code","text":"loadLocale(id)"},{"t":"text","text":" resolves once the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"catalogue is in; only then does "},{"t":"code","text":"setLocale"},{"t":"text","text":" accept it."}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"warning","caption":"A locale must be listed to be named","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"setLocale"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"loadLocale"},{"t":"text","text":" are keyed on the ids in "},{"t":"code","text":"locales"},{"t":"text","text":", so today a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"locale that is "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"not"}]},{"t":"text","text":" in that array cannot be named without a cast — while a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"locale that "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"is"}]},{"t":"text","text":" in it counts as already loaded and never reaches the loader."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"In practice that means the fully lazy catalogue is not expressible in the types"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"yet. List every locale, and treat "},{"t":"code","text":"loader"},{"t":"text","text":" as the retry-safe cache in front of"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"whatever your own loading code does."}]}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A lazily obtained locale is not present at construction, so it is "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"not"}]},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"covered by the startup parity check. Keep it covered by "},{"t":"code","text":"npm run i18n:check"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"which reads the files rather than the runtime."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"next","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Next"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/i18n/effect","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"With Effect"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — the same keys, as an "},{"t":"code","text":"Effect"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"translating","text":"Translating"},{"level":2,"id":"reactive-translation","text":"Reactive translation"},{"level":3,"id":"di-inside-a-translation","text":"DI inside a translation"},{"level":2,"id":"loading-catalogues","text":"Loading catalogues"},{"level":2,"id":"next","text":"Next"}]}